From: Govindarajulu Varadarajan <govindarajulu.varadarajan@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 14:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] xilinx-ai-engine: partition init optimizations

Apply the following optimizations to the partition initialization path:

- Do DMA pause only when column/shim reset is set
- Batch ZEROIZEMEM and UC_ENB_MEM_PRIV with other non-data ops
- Defer outstanding txn check after resource cleanup
- Move handshake flush to callers
- Remove redundant flush and goto in handshake pm_ops
- Fix interrupt value for HW error in part init (use NPI line 1)
- Remove redundant aie2ps_priv_error_handling_init()
- Consolidate pm_ops batching in part initialize
- Separate error halt event from error handling init
- Split error handling init to shim and mem/aie tile init
- Split group error init into per-tile-type functions

Signed-off-by: Govindarajulu Varadarajan <govindarajulu.varadarajan@amd.com>
---
